From c23049bd10376709e05122bb93b172a73e1e9228 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Marek Czernek <marek.czernek@suse.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 12:58:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Stabilize testsuite (#791)

* SSH test fixes for debian 13

* Ensure test_suse cleans up defined repositories

* Fix test_master::test_mworker_pass_context

* Fix test_events_api_handler test

---------

Co-authored-by: Daniel A. Wozniak <daniel.wozniak@broadcom.com>
